0:During the Seo Empire war against the Kingdom of Rushia, the Sydrian Archipelago was lost to the enemy. After we stopped the assault aimed at attacking the mainland of the Empire, the time has come to reconquer the isles lost in fight with the Rushians. We need to destroy enemy settlements and turn the Archipelago into the wealthy land it once was.||[$0707FF]Difficulty Rating:[] *||Map uses [$E1FA6B]Strangelove's[] improved AI script.|Map uses [$7A7AEB]Cmowla's[] Anti Lure script (4.3b).
1:We landed on the smallest Island of the Sydrian Archipelago called Cyllene. Rushian forces ignored it because of its small metal reserves. Lets use it to our advantage and begin our expansion across the archipelago from here. The only threat here are local savages. Clear them out and continue our conquest.
2:We took control of the abandoned warehouse. Our colony on Cyllene will provide us with shipments of goods to aid the fighters. Enemy presence is still strong in the region, the only wares we can transport are [$6BD0FA]gold[] and [$9E6BFA]wine[], when we gain a higher control over the seas, we will be able to transport more. Gather them in the storehouse in the port that belonged to the savages. 
3:[$09F694]Transport from Cyllene in[]
4:[$F6CC09]Transport from Kalyke in[]
5:[$6B6BFA]Transport from Pazyfae in[]
6:Cyllene is completely under our control now. Our troops have already landed on Kalyke, a nearby isle to the east to continue our campaign. Beware though, there is an outpost of Rushian troops located on this island and they will not give it up without a fight.
7:The Rushian outpost has been sacked by our brave warriors. This will hit enemy where it really hurts. We setup a base on Pazyfae, the biggest island in the archipelago with huge iron reserves that are currently under Rushian control. Our settlement is located away from enemy towns which should give us some time to prepare before they notice us.
8:Settlements on Cyllene and Kalyke shall provide our new colony with supplies. Since the destruction of the enemy outpost, we have gained more control of the seas so we can transport new types of resources. The Colony on Cyllene now can transport [$185B7D]tree trunks[]. The Colony on Kalyke will provide us with shipments of [$6BD0FA]gold[] and [$8CD9D4]corn[].
9:Time to assault the main enemy fortress on Amalthea island. If we manage to take it over, the whole Sydrian Archipelago will again belong to the Seo Empire!
10:All colonies will now ship their resources to aid our army in destroying the enemy fortress. Now that we control the sea in the region we can freely transport our resouces. Cyllene shall now also transport [$6B9EFA]leather[] and [$78B4D5]loaves[]. Kalyke will now additionally ship its [$0909F6]sausages[] and [$09B0F6]timber[] meanwhile Pazyfae will grant the new colony its [$3A3A3A]coal[] and [$DF204D]iron[].
11:Our colony has been spoted by fishermen from Rushian settlements. Enemy will not ignore our presence any longer, therefore we have to bolster our defences before they strike!
12:We ought to focus our efforts on creating as strong army as possible. Use resources from other settlements to prepare as enemy won't wait long before trying to destroy our camp.
